1
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:21,199
She sits right beside me.

2
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:28,100
Jasmine fills the air.

3
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,600
A soft voice speaks so low.

4
00:00:36,899 --> 00:00:43,100
No wild storm is there.

5
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:50,600
"Hi, my name is Ginger."

6
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:57,600
My voice sounds thin and small.

7
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:02,399
"I'm P-Paul,"

8
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:11,299
I stutter out. Warm smile inside the hall.

9
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:20,099
I confess the organ keys.

10
00:01:21,099 --> 00:01:27,400
Afraid she'll mock my head.

11
00:01:28,099 --> 00:01:34,400
She looks right into me.

12
00:01:35,099 --> 00:01:42,099
Kind eyes at what I said.

13
00:01:43,099 --> 00:01:49,099
"Music is music, Paul."

14
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:56,099
Her soft voice stays so clear.

15
00:01:56,599 --> 00:02:03,099
My frozen tension melts.

16
00:02:04,099 --> 00:02:10,599
I lose my quiet fear.

17
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:18,099
Her dark eyes look in mine.

18
00:02:19,099 --> 00:02:25,400
Safe in her gentle shade.

19
00:02:26,099 --> 00:02:32,599
For ten short seconds here.

20
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:40,099
A sweet connection made.

21
00:02:41,099 --> 00:02:47,599
"Music is music, Paul."

22
00:02:48,099 --> 00:02:54,599
Her words stay in my mind.

23
00:02:55,400 --> 00:03:02,099
Before the cold wall returns...

24
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:10,099
And leaves me far behind...